        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1305-a1">

                <pb facs="1040" n="924" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg924"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">
                        Mine and Smelter Operators Association to all members</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chihuahua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-04">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 4, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>To all members: Enclosed find copy of official advice from the Minister to the
                    effect that the mining law of March 19 will not go into effect until a later
                    date. While this communication does not bear date, it was written and delivered
                    to Mr. George C. Carothers, representative of the State Department, on
                    yesterday.* * *</p>
                <p>Yours very truly,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">F. E. Stevenson</hi>, <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
